  "callCount": 1,
  "anchoredLines": [
    {
      "day": 26,
      "line": "🕯️ Word comes back with a torn pack and no Eli. Static, out past the ridge. The fire is quieter tonight."
    },
    {
      "day": 27,
      "line": "🌒 Dusk. They come out of the treeline in a knot — 2 of them, thin and road-worn — and stop at the edge of your firelight like they're not sure they're allowed closer. The oldest steps forward. \"Peter Adeyemi. From Stonebridge.\" A pause. \"We're asking for a fire.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 30,
      "line": "🌒 Dusk. They come out of the treeline in a knot — 2 of them, thin and road-worn — and stop at the edge of your firelight like they're not sure they're allowed closer. The oldest steps forward. \"Rosa Weber. From Emberhold.\" A pause. \"We're asking for a fire.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 92,
      "line": "🌪️ THE HERALD struck Thornfield in the night. They bled while the coalition talked. (trust −5 — they notice who wasn't there.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 92,
      "line": "📯 THE CALL GOES OUT — THE HERALD must fall, and no one fire can do it."
    },
    {
      "day": 92,
      "line": "— Emberhold answers! Jesse Ali and Amara Diallo will march. (trust holds — they are counting on you.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 92,
      "line": "— Thornfield answers! Marcus Lund and Ben Garcia will march. (trust holds — they are counting on you.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 92,
      "line": "— Ashford answers! Grace Khan and Ruth Kim will march. (trust holds — they are counting on you.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 92,
      "line": "🛡️ Hannah, Sabah, Grace step forward. They will march with the muster, eat from your stores (1000 kcal/day each), and stand in front of THE HERALD. They can die — Haven does not get them back, and the fire will be quieter. Tap again — Haven sends its own."
    },
    {
      "day": 92,
      "line": "🛡️ Haven commits its own: Hannah, Sabah, Grace march with the muster. Not loaned. Not asked-for. Ours. The coalition counts 9 blades against THE HERALD — it needs 10."
    },
    {
      "day": 93,
      "line": "🍽️ The muster is hungry — 180 of 9,000 kcal fed. Bellies remember who feeds them. (loyalty strains when the food runs thin.) (trust −2 per fire per day while the muster stands hungry.)"
    },
    {
